OOG = a stone age cartoon caveman with a pale off-white round head and a
short rounded off-white bulb body, his head noticeably LARGER than his torso
— about one and a half times as wide. Messy dark brown hair with one thick
tuft standing straight up on top. Thick dark brown eyebrows. Two large round
white eyes with big black pupils and three white highlight dots each. A
black-outlined mouth that shows a row of square white teeth when he grins.
He wears a rough brown fur strap over one shoulder and a brown fur skirt
held up by a twisted rope belt. Bare feet, drawn as simple off-white ovals.
Thin solid black line arms and legs ending in small off-white mitten hands
with a visible thumb notch. Bold black outlines with a slight brush taper,
flat cel shading, no gradient.
